"""Independent semantic model of the generated LAMMPS inputs.

Parses the generated script, re-implements the *meaning* of the commands it
uses (pair_style lj/cut/soft, fix adapt/fep, compute fep) and compares the
observable declared for the thermodynamic-integration column with the exact
derivative dU/dlambda of the coupled Hamiltonian.
